  "title": "Layered Salad",
  "description": "Use your 9x13-inch dish or a glass bowl to show off the colorful layers of lettuce, hard-cooked egg, water chestnuts, peas, chopped tomato, and crumbled bacon topped with a creamy homemade dressing.",
  "authors": [
    "FRANCESWOOD"
